iew.custom.tags\n\t\tresult \u003d HBT.AzureRESTAPI.createWorkItem(projectName, organization, workItemType, personalAccessToken, title, description, expectedResult, actualResult, stepsToRecreate, priority, areaPath, iterationPath, tags)\n\t\tworkId \u003d \u0027\u0027\n\t\tif result is not None:\n\t\t\tif \u0027id\u0027 in result.keys():\n\t\t\t\tworkId \u003d result[\u0027id\u0027]\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\tparameters \u003d {\t\u0027title\u0027:title, \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0027description\u0027:description,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0027expected_result\u0027:expectedResult,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0027actual_result\u0027:actualResult,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0027steps_to_recreate\u0027:stepsToRecreate,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0027priority\u0027:priority, \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0027username\u0027:issuerName, \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0027type\u0027:workItemType, \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0027work_id\u0027:workId,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0027created_date\u0027:system.date.parse(issueDate,\"MMMM dd, yyyy, hh:mm a\"),\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0027area_path\u0027:areaPath,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0027iteration_path\u0027:iterationPath,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0027tags\u0027:tags}\n\t\t\t\t\t  \n\t\tsystem.db.runNamedQuery(\"IssueLogs/Insert\",parameters)\n\t\t\n\t\tHBT.Alerts.showAlert(state\u003d\"success\",title\u003d\"Success\",message\u003d\u0027Issue log successful!\u0027,showCloseBtn\u003dFalse,btnTextPrimary\u003d\"Okay\",btnTextSecondary\u003d\"\",btnActionPrimary\u003d\"commitIssueLog\",btnActionSecondary\u003d\"\",payload\u003d{})\n\t\t"
